#: ../doc/keyboard.rst:277
msgid ""
"The table shows OpenShot's Windows/Linux defaults, Adobe Premiere Pro and "
"DaVinci Resolve Windows defaults, and Final Cut Pro Mac defaults. On macOS, "
"OpenShot uses Command for shortcuts shown with Ctrl. Shortcuts in other "
"editors can vary with the version, keyboard layout, selected preset, and "
"active panel. Similar shortcuts can also behave differently on stacked or "
"connected clips."
msgstr ""
"Tablica prikazuje zadane postavke OpenShota za Windows/Linux, zadane "
"postavke Adobe Premiere Pro i DaVinci Resolve za Windows te zadane postavke "
"Final Cut Pro za Mac. Na macOS-u, OpenShot koristi Command za prečace "
"prikazane s Ctrl. Prečaci u drugim uređivačima mogu varirati ovisno o "
"verziji, rasporedu tipkovnice, odabranom predlošku i aktivnom panelu. Slični"
" prečaci također se mogu drugačije ponašati na složenim ili povezanim "
"isječcima."

